1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,000
W: What are all of these boxes doing here in the office?

2
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:10,660
M: I was at lunch when they arrived, so I'm not sure, but it appears as if the computer monitors the Accounting Department ordered have arrived.

3
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:16,280
W: Well, we have some clients coming momentarily, so they have to be removed at once.

4
00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:21,605
M: Okay, I'll call the secretary there and make sure someone comes here to take them away.

5
00:00:21,745 --> 00:00:22,180
W: Thanks, Fred.

6
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:25,585
After doing that, would you mind straightening up the conference room?

7
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:27,700
I noticed it was a bit messy.

8
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:28,940
M: No problem.

9
00:00:29,490 --> 00:00:31,240
I'll get right on it as soon as I make the call.
